1
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:49,520
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:51,520
=Episode 8=

3
00:00:57,039 --> 00:00:57,840
Xiao Maizi.

4
00:00:59,039 --> 00:01:01,000
Hehe.

5
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,119
Mm.

6
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:04,040
You're back!

7
00:01:04,719 --> 00:01:05,640
This is for you.

8
00:01:09,439 --> 00:01:11,480
Where is my sister?

9
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:14,079
Why didn't she come back with you?

10
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,319
Your sister...

11
00:01:27,079 --> 00:01:28,799
She's gone traveling the world,

12
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:29,599
hasn't she?

13
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:33,920
Yes.

14
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:37,719
Xiao Maizi.

15
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:46,079
She must've gone ahead
to see what's out there for me.

16
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:47,879
We promised

17
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:51,439
we'd see the most beautiful places
in the world together.

18
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,599
One day,

19
00:01:53,799 --> 00:01:55,439
we will meet again.

20
00:01:58,079 --> 00:01:58,879
That's right.

21
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:01,680
You will see her again.

22
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:02,480
Mm.

23
00:02:06,079 --> 00:02:06,879
Xiao Maizi.

24
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,520
Xiao Maizi.

25
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,479
We brought you some treats.

26
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:17,120
Eat up

27
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:18,599
and grow strong.

28
00:02:18,919 --> 00:02:19,800
Okay?

29
00:02:22,039 --> 00:02:22,840
Xiao Maizi.

30
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,159
This one is good.

31
00:02:27,599 --> 00:02:28,280
Is it good?

32
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,520
I'm going to eat well

33
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:30,560
and grow up fast.

34
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,120
Mm.

35
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:32,360
I promised my sister.

36
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:37,800
From now on,

37
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,280
I'll take care of Xiao Maizi.

38
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:42,520
I'll never marry.

39
00:02:42,919 --> 00:02:43,840
I'll be there for her,

40
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,400
like her sister was.

41
00:02:46,879 --> 00:02:48,199
I'll make sure their promise lives on.

42
00:02:54,159 --> 00:02:54,960
Doctor Ge.

43
00:02:55,639 --> 00:02:57,120
I have three pouches for you.

44
00:02:57,599 --> 00:02:58,080
Here.

45
00:02:58,879 --> 00:03:00,639
The first is a Protection Spell.

46
00:03:01,439 --> 00:03:03,280
I've carved the spell into your house.

47
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,680
If a demon comes

48
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,840
or you're in danger, open it.

49
00:03:07,039 --> 00:03:08,479
It will shield you from evil.

50
00:03:12,719 --> 00:03:14,639
The second is a Rebirth Spell.

51
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:17,719
On the anniversary
of Xiao Maizi's sister's death,

52
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:19,599
open this pouch,

53
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:20,960
light some incense,

54
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:23,199
and it will light her way
into her next life.

55
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,159
Try this.

56
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:27,759
May she never know
the bitterness of this world again,

57
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,319
and be born into a good home.

58
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,599
And the third pouch...

59
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:38,080
only open it after we've left.

60
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:39,000
Remember that.

61
00:03:42,599 --> 00:03:43,840
We owe you our lives. Thank you.

62
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:45,080
May you

63
00:03:45,199 --> 00:03:46,080
be blessed

64
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:47,919
with good fortune,

65
00:03:48,039 --> 00:03:49,039
and find smooth roads ahead,

66
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,120
with peace and joy all your days.

67
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,080
Mm.

68
00:03:56,639 --> 00:03:58,599
Thank you.

69
00:04:07,199 --> 00:04:10,360
Farewell. Be happy.

70
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:14,360
Hey, Yuanchu.

71
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:17,519
What did you put in that last pouch?

72
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:21,040
Why can't they open it until we leave?

73
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:24,120
All our money.

74
00:04:24,959 --> 00:04:25,759
Oh.

75
00:04:28,519 --> 00:04:29,319
What?

76
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:33,160
That was all our money!

77
00:04:33,319 --> 00:04:34,160
In your mortal realm,

78
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:36,240
a few coins
can bring a hero to his knees.

79
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:37,959
And we've got
a whole group of Taoists here!

80
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,399
We're broke!

81
00:04:39,399 --> 00:04:40,800
How are we supposed to get to

82
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:41,399
the Wilds of Lize?

83
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:44,360
Looks like I will have to fight dogs
for scraps again.

84
00:04:46,439 --> 00:04:48,120
Money is meant to be spent.

85
00:04:48,279 --> 00:04:50,040
If it buys hope for someone,

86
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,560
then it's money well spent.

87
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:54,319
That sounds nice and all,

88
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:56,480
but we have nothing left.

89
00:04:57,079 --> 00:05:01,040
You humans can't get anywhere
without money.

90
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,600
Us demons have it so much easier.

91
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:07,399
Time to bring out my secret weapon.

92
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:10,279
One bite of this flatbread
keeps you full for three days,

93
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:11,279
and off the toilet for five!

94
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:12,879
The Wilds of Lize

95
00:05:13,839 --> 00:05:14,720
will be a breeze with this.

96
00:05:16,519 --> 00:05:18,399
Stop feeding me that nonsense!

97
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,720
Wow, that is amazing!

98
00:05:23,879 --> 00:05:25,439
You turned it into a flying flatbread!

99
00:05:40,879 --> 00:05:42,199
Why did you send everyone away

100
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:44,120
and bring me here?

101
00:05:44,399 --> 00:05:46,839
Because I need you to heal me.

102
00:05:50,439 --> 00:05:51,519
Our grandmaster's teachings:

103
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:53,000
Once you enter the Taoist path,

104
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,560
you must follow the precepts.

105
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,680
No lust. No attachment.

106
00:05:59,399 --> 00:06:02,120
You humans always say
that a small kindness

107
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:03,160
should be repaid tenfold.

108
00:06:03,319 --> 00:06:04,800
Now it's time to repay me.

109
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:13,240
I am influenced
by the Divine Stone's power.

110
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:15,560
The Purestone Bloom
holds both Yin and Yang,

111
00:06:16,439 --> 00:06:17,800
so I keep shifting between forms.

112
00:06:18,839 --> 00:06:19,879
If this keeps happening,

113
00:06:20,079 --> 00:06:21,519
I'll wither away and die.

114
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:27,680
Only you can help stabilize my power.

115
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:30,920
But...

116
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,639
why me?

117
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,360
Enough questions.

118
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:50,839
Wake up.

119
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:52,839
Wake up.

120
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,040
You're back.

121
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:57,920
(Pesky Taoist!)

122
00:06:58,279 --> 00:07:00,959
(You're going to
flatten my gorgeous face!)

123
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,079
Idiot.

124
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,040
You tricked me again.

125
00:07:19,839 --> 00:07:20,879
You demons are all the same.

126
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,079
That's right!

127
00:07:23,079 --> 00:07:24,279
I tricked you. So what?

128
00:07:26,319 --> 00:07:27,399
You really have no idea

129
00:07:27,399 --> 00:07:28,720
what's good for you.

130
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:31,319
Do you know how many people
dream of kissing me?

131
00:07:31,319 --> 00:07:33,040
They'd give anything for the chance.

132
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:36,519
They'd cry and beg just to see me.

133
00:07:36,519 --> 00:07:38,519
In the Void Realm,

134
00:07:38,519 --> 00:07:39,879
thousands of souls
longed to rest on my arms.

135
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,720
Don't talk about yourself like that.

136
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,040
Oh?

137
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:52,000
You actually care about me?

138
00:07:54,519 --> 00:07:55,800
Care enough

139
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:56,959
to get angry?

140
00:07:57,439 --> 00:07:59,319
I...

141
00:08:01,839 --> 00:08:02,639
I...

142
00:08:03,319 --> 00:08:04,920
What I care about is

143
00:08:05,399 --> 00:08:07,040
whether I can fix

144
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,480
your Yin-Yang imbalance.

145
00:08:12,879 --> 00:08:13,680
Oh.

146
00:08:23,399 --> 00:08:25,000
You're not falling for me, are you?

147
00:08:33,519 --> 00:08:34,360
Oh my.

148
00:08:34,519 --> 00:08:36,320
That would be perfectly normal.

149
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:39,480
With charm like mine,

150
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,799
it's only natural.

151
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:43,159
Actually,

152
00:08:44,159 --> 00:08:45,159
in my eyes,

153
00:08:46,639 --> 00:08:48,440
you've always been a woman.

154
00:08:50,399 --> 00:08:51,200
What?

155
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,519
Since when?

156
00:08:52,679 --> 00:08:53,600
Ever since

157
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:55,440
you had that Deceit Beast sting me.

158
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,600
In my eyes,

159
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:58,080
you've been a woman all along.

160
00:08:58,799 --> 00:09:00,519
The only way I can tell you've changed

161
00:09:00,679 --> 00:09:02,480
is by your voice.

162
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:03,559
What?

163
00:09:03,559 --> 00:09:04,639
So all this time,

164
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,759
you've been...

165
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,279
You pervert!

166
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:15,399
Keep your heart pure.

167
00:09:16,279 --> 00:09:17,279
Banish demonic presence.

168
00:09:17,879 --> 00:09:19,039
Let righteousness shine.

169
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:31,519
What did you just put into me?

170
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:32,919
It actually feels nice.

171
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:35,120
The Wind God Chronicle

172
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:37,799
has the power to cleanse and heal.

173
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:40,000
It should stabilize you for a while.

174
00:09:40,519 --> 00:09:42,840
At least you won't suddenly
shift between genders.

175
00:09:45,519 --> 00:09:46,639
From now on,

176
00:09:46,639 --> 00:09:47,720
I'll heal you.

177
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:52,720
Pesky Taoist.

178
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:55,480
Trying to make me owe you even more?

179
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,240
To look out for one another

180
00:09:58,039 --> 00:09:59,120
is what friendship is about.

181
00:09:59,799 --> 00:10:01,559
But don't you humans say

182
00:10:02,159 --> 00:10:04,679
there's no such thing as pure friendship
between a man and a woman?

183
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:07,360
Then a young Taoist

184
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:08,440
and a little demoness...

185
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:09,519
What would that be?

186
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:11,320
It would be...

187
00:10:11,519 --> 00:10:12,960
the little demoness's...

188
00:10:13,559 --> 00:10:14,639
Hey, say it again.

189
00:10:14,639 --> 00:10:15,639
Say it again!

190
00:10:15,799 --> 00:10:17,639
Say it again, you pesky Taoist!

191
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:19,559
Little Demoness.

192
00:10:19,799 --> 00:10:20,759
Say it again.

193
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:22,240
Pesky Taoist.

194
00:10:22,919 --> 00:10:23,720
Little Demoness.

195
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:24,799
Ah!

196
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:26,440
Say it! Say it! Say it!

197
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:27,799
It would be...

198
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:29,320
an old demoness.

199
00:10:32,039 --> 00:10:33,000
I'll kill you!

200
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:52,840
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

201
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:56,240
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

202
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:59,760
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

203
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:03,080
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

204
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:10,000
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

205
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:17,595
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

206
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:21,840
♪Let towering waves come crashing down;
I'll fight against the tide♪

207
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:25,680
♪I shatter the hollow fate
they wrote for me♪

208
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:32,480
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
